Package: qml
Title: Quantum Machine Learning for Classification
Version: 0.2.1
Authors@R: 
    person("Xopre", "Rodríguez Gallego", , "rodgal.2020@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-5825-2724"))
Description: A modern implementation of quantum machine learning classification using the 
    Density Matrix (DM) algorithm. This package provides quantum-inspired machine 
    learning methods for classification tasks, implementing the DM model 
    with quantum density matrices. Features include standard R modeling interface 
    with predict() and summary() methods, modular architecture for maintainability, 
    and compatibility with tidymodels ecosystem including rsample for data splitting.
